      "side": 1,
      "message": "Frank, can you PTAL? I\u0027m interested in trying out this change against the Mega CQ but I can\u0027t do so until I send a CL to roll DEPS in chromium/src. Generally, what do you think about this change? Are there good reasons not to link this data into the binaries that need it by default?",
      "revId": "db1be1e80a9de4943a1064321f95047ab82b0670",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
